WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.046
Kusheh en welkom to payroll officer training.

2
00:00:03.046 --> 00:00:08.699
Na ya salary de turn to payment — correct, on time, en fully compliant with Salone tax law.

3
00:00:08.699 --> 00:00:16.714
Wi go run payroll preview, understand di gross-to-net calculation, export payslip en bank file dem, en look statutory compliance.

4
00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:22.226
Dis na di payroll page. Pick di month en year, den always preview before yu run.

5
00:00:22.226 --> 00:00:36.594
Di preview de calculate every workman in gross pay, apply di N R A progressive P A Y E band dem, remove di five percent NASSIT employee contribution, apply any loan repayment — en show yu di exact net pay, en nothing no commit yet.

6
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.822
When di preview look correct, di run button de commit am.

7
00:00:49.822 --> 00:01:05.738
For government tenant dem, SaloneHCM go first check di budget for di period, respect di payroll cut-off lock, en send di run go di Ministry of Finance approval chain — usai di required number of different signature dem must collect before di run approve.

8
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.093
Every completed run de show na di history below.

9
00:01:10.093 --> 00:01:22.058
From de yu de download individual payslip P D F dem, send bulk payslip S M S message, en generate bank disbursement file na Rokel, S L C B, U B A, or Ecobank format — ready for upload go yu bank portal.

10
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:31.098
Di compliance page de track yu statutory obligation dem: monthly P A Y E return to di N R A en NASSIT contribution schedule dem.

11
00:01:31.098 --> 00:01:36.984
SaloneHCM de generate di export na di exact expected format — pick di period, generate, en file.

12
00:01:36.984 --> 00:01:40.050
Di deadline dem de track so nothing no go pass yu.

13
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:48.329
Di golden rule dem: preview before yu run, no ever bypass blocked budget check, en file yu return before di deadline.

14
00:01:48.329 --> 00:01:52.866
Go take di payroll officer quiz na di Training Center for certify yu skill.
